// Copy this file to Config/Secrets.Debug.xcconfig (or .Staging / .Release) and fill in
// real values. Every Config/Secrets.*.xcconfig is gitignored and must stay that way.
// Each configuration includes only its own file, so the three environments cannot
// accidentally share a Cloudflare environment.
//
// Rule 4: there is NO credential here, and there must never be one. The app authenticates
// with a user session token obtained at sign-in. Cloudflare API tokens, the session
// signing key, APNs credentials and the RevenueCat webhook secret are Worker secrets
// (`wrangler secret put`) and never reach the client. AppConfiguration refuses to launch
// if it finds anything credential-shaped in the bundle.
//
// Remember the `//` comment gotcha — compose URLs with $(MM_SLASH):
//   MM_API_BASE_URL = https:$(MM_SLASH)$(MM_SLASH)api.mymiracles.app

MM_API_BASE_URL = http:$(MM_SLASH)$(MM_SLASH)127.0.0.1:8787

// Optional: override the signing team for a different developer account.
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = XXXXXXXXXX
